# audiomancer CLI overview demo
Output docs/assets/gifs/cli-overview.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Padding 20

Type "cd ~/Development/audiomancer"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "# audiomancer - AI-assisted music production"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "uv run audiomancer --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# Check system health"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "uv run audiomancer doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "# View library stats"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "uv run audiomancer stats"
Enter
Sleep 3s
